{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52553","headline":"候夜行师七唱 · 陈元光","name":"候夜行师七唱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从长发离京城，侍父寒暄经万程。\n上吁玄天低吁地，朝瞻红日夜瞻星。\n诸君喜抵王师所，四顾伤爲荆莽垧。\n羣落妻拏凄泣声，俄然戎丑万交横。\n司空淑人频劝谕，英雄死义无求生。\n马皮远裹伏波骨，铜柱高标交趾惊。\n振旅龙江修战具，移文凤阙请增兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}